Z||000005||Dan||04-25-2000||09:52 PM|||| Seriously, they slip down into the inside door wipe and are made by RubberQueen part # 5121, and found at PepBoys,I think $7.99 each.You can locate them just right on the door,and they have my Wife's approval.So far I haven"t found any other cup holder that works decent.Did I mention they are great? They have advustable wings to hold any size container.Can also hold a coffee cup because it has a slit in the wings.Trying to get more info from manufactuter and will post as I recieve it.||||reg||1
