Z||000008||Shiner||04-25-2000||10:39 PM||||Don't you guys know about the "built in" cup holder?  Take that cup of coffee, slide it down the right side of the instrument cluster, and it nestles in there very firmly.  I can't really explain it better, but next time you get a cup of coffee, try it!  It really does work!||||reg||1
Z||000009||Racer 1||04-26-2000||12:28 AM||||Just get them ballpark hard hat double drink holder. Then you can drink while you drive and not get killed. You can slide a drink between you and the middle rest by the set belt if your not to fat!||||reg||10
Z||000010||DRH||04-26-2000||07:10 PM||||You can hang 1 or 2 regular plastic cupholders in the passenger side ash tray. Driver's side cause severe interference problems with the driver's leg. Not real attractive... but easy to get rid of when not in use.<P>I haven't seen any that were "deep" enough to hang in the window. I'll anxiously await for more info...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||3
